      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This goes the same way for world favorites.  I find it sad that you cannot open the world to teleport to it if you do not have VRC+.  I understand that if you don't pay for VRC+ anymore, you shouldn't be able to add or remove favs. from the folder,  but  at very least you should be able to teleport to the world in the favorites folder. This sucks for world creators because people (users) aren't going to go to the world if you have to go through hoops to get to it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
