  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2025-05-22T01:18:49.140Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I noticed that the behavior of favorite avatars outside of the first favorites category were changed, and it feels a bit harder on those that used to have VRC+ as you're no longer able to move avatars that you previously categorized if you no longer have VRC+.\n\nThis change could be seen as a somewhat predatory one, especially to those that are used to the original behavior and can't or don't want to pay for VRC+ again, considering that you're completely removing a feature that was free and making it a paid one.\n\nI ask that you please restore the original functionality of this feature.",
